      1 system | origin={"kind":"peer","from":"Impl-G3-P2","senderTaskId":"aImpl-G3-P2-dd6ba0eab35f50b8","name":"Impl-G3-P2","body":"PAKETMELDUNG LANE B / Scheibe B6 (S6 RAM-Spool 256MB + portabler Writer-Thread, CT-Strategy) — FERTIG, verifiziert.\n\nNEUE Dateien (in meinem Scope, builder/artifact_transport/ — nur NEUE Dateien, async_push_pump.hpp/artifact_cache.hpp UNBERUEHRT):\n- ram_spool.hpp (66 Z.): RamSpool mit Trigger Groesse >= kMaxSpoolBytes(256MB) ODER Anzahl >= kSpoolCountTrigger(12), was zuerst; SpoolEntry{dest,bytes}; drain().\n- writer_backend_portable.hpp (35 Z.): PortableWriterBackend (ofstream binary, legt Elterndirs an) = Korrektheits-Referenz aller Backends (B21), name()==\"portable\".\n- spool_writer.hpp (181 Z.): CT-Strategy. concept SpoolWriterBackend; template<SpoolWriterBackend B> class SpoolWriter (RAM-Spool + dedizierter Writer-Thread; submit()/flush()-Barrier/close(); pending_count = Crash-Fenster, persisted_count); CT-Backend-Wahl per COMDARE_WRITER_BACKEND_* Define (Default portable, io_uring/winring #if-gegated -> nur gewaehlter Header inkludiert); ActiveWriterBackend + ActiveSpoolWriter + static_assert(Vertrag). KEIN Runtime-Switch.\n- tests/unit/test_g3_ram_spool_writer.cpp (169 Z., 9 Faelle).\n\nCMakeLists: +9/-0 (B6-Block; test linkt Threads::Threads).\n\nVERIFIKATION (build-ninja-s4):\ncf22 --dry-run --Werror: alle 4 Dateien exit=0\nBuild test_g3_ram_spool_writer: OHNE Warnung.\nctest:\n  #307 test_g3_ram_spool_writer .... Passed (9 Faelle: Trigger-by-count, Trigger-by-size, PortableByteIdentity vs Direktschreiben, CreatesParentDirs, PersistsOnFlush, TriggerPersistsBatch, ByteIdentityVsDirect, CrashWindowPendingNotOnDisk, ActiveBackendIsPortableByDefault)\n  Alle 6 G3-Tests zusammen: 100% tests passed, 0 tests failed out of 6\nAdditiv -> bestehende Suite unberuehrt.\n\nFREEZE: ram_spool.hpp + writer_backend_portable.hpp + spool_writer.hpp + test_g3_ram_spool_writer.cpp + B6-CMakeLists-Block.\n\nNAECHSTES: B7 (io_uring) -- liburing